      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i was reading online that sediment can make a popping or knocking noise when the water heats up and expands around it. but it feels so random, like it happens at different times of night. could it be something else like air in the pipes or just the metal expanding and contracting? it's driving me a bit crazy.",
